          "text": "🌍 Today is World #EarthDay! Let’s unite for Our Power, Our Planet and push for a greener future powered by renewables.  \nRenewable energy sources, such as wind and solar, already allowed the EU to cut emissions by 8% (2023) and save €59B in fossil fuel imports (since 2019).  \n🔥 2024 was the hottest year on record. The time to act is now — let’s invest in renewables, set bold 2040 climate targets, and reach climate neutrality by 2050\n #GreenDeal"
